                            "steamid": "76561197970287177",
                            "num_reviews": 121,
                            "playtime_forever": 10,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 10,
                            "last_played": 1512644913
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Feels like a macromedia flash game.\n\nThis is clunky. As an example, a button says \"Repair Everythin\", then a \"g\" is found about 200 pixels to the right of it. Movement alone is absolute hell. This reminds me of those old macromedia cd games, the commercial ones in stores, not online ones. This game clearly has a lot of effort put into it, but absolutely no common sense.\n\nIt feels like a 14 year old threw it together as a labor of love. Well, I commend them for their effort, but politely ask that they please not do it again...",
